$ current registry/order and current raw-store inspection
MigrateNativeWorkingContextSnapshotsV5Migration is registered before RawTraceRotationLayoutMigration and RawTraceActiveFileNameMigration.
The native migration materializes facts through RunMemoryFileStore.listRawTracesOrdered(), which reads raw_traces_active.jsonl.
RawTraceActiveFileNameMigration is the retained required migration that renames legacy raw_traces.jsonl to raw_traces_active.jsonl.

